        "content": "## Meta leads — reconcile (safety net)\n\nEvery 15 minutes: compare the lead IDs in Meta with the lead IDs already logged, and replay any missing lead through the live capture workflow.\n\n**Why it exists:** Meta silently stops delivering webhooks in some app states. A real lead was lost that way once. This makes sure it can't happen twice.\n\nSafe to run repeatedly — a lead that is already logged is never written again.",
